" ☐ to do"
    0-2 fg=muted bg=background
    3-7 fg=fg bg=background
" ☑ done"
    0-0 fg=muted bg=background
    1-1 fg=success bg=background
    2-2 fg=muted bg=background
    3-6 fg=fg bg=background
" • plain"
    0-2 fg=muted bg=background
    3-7 fg=fg bg=background
